"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1016005","helmet":"WP1024605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1001","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[72,31,77,78,62,54],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1016005","helmet":"WP1024605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1001","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[72,31,77,78,62,54],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1016005","helmet":"WP1024605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10058","city":"CS1001","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[72,31,77,78,62,54],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1016005","helmet":"WP1024605"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"魏国官臣，汉末名士，擅长天文、写作。刘廙初仕刘表，后随曹操，曹丕继位后，官至侍中，深受曹丕器重。建安年间，刘廙之弟刘伟因魏讽谋反而被牵连，按照当时律法刘廙应受牵连，但在曹操的赦令下，刘廙不但没有受刑，反被提升为丞相仓曹属。","tc":"魏國官臣，漢末名士，擅長天文、寫作。劉廙初仕劉表，后隨曹操，曹丕繼位后，官至侍中，深受曹丕器重。建安年間，劉廙之弟劉偉因魏諷謀反而被牽連，按照當時律法劉廙應受牽連，但在曹操的赦令下，劉廙不但沒有受刑，反被提升為丞相倉曹屬。","en":"An official of Wei and a celebrated figure of the late Han, skilled in astronomy and literary composition. Liu Yi initially served under Liu Biao, later followed Cao Cao, and after Cao Pi's accession rose to the rank of Commandant, deeply trusted by Cao Pi. During the Jian'an era, his younger brother Liu Wei was implicated in Wei Feng's rebellion. Under the law at the time, Liu Yi should have been implicated as well, but Cao Cao issued a special pardon. Not only was Liu Yi spared punishment, he was promoted to Granary Clerk under the Prime Minister.","jp":"魏の臣、後漢末の名士。天文や文章に長けていた。劉廙は初め劉表に仕え、後に曹操に従った。曹丕が後を継ぐと侍中に任じられ、深く重用された。建安年間、弟の劉偉が魏諷の謀反に連座したため、当時の法では劉廙も連座するところであったが、曹操の恩赦によって処罰を免れただけでなく、丞相倉曹属へと抜擢された。","kr":"위나라의 관원이자 한나라 말기의 명사로, 천문과 문장에 능했다. 유익은 처음에 유표를 섬겼으나 이후 조조를 따랐으며, 조비가 즉위한 뒤에는 관직이 시중에 이르러 조비의 두터운 신임을 받았다. 건안 연간에 아우 유위가 위풍의 반역에 연루되어 당시의 율법대로라면 유익 역시 연좌 처벌을 받아야 마땅했으나, 조조의 사면령 덕분에 처벌을 면했을 뿐만 아니라 오히려 승상창조속으로 승진했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10944","remark":"","surname":"刘","surnameTc":"劉","surnameEn":"Liu","surnameJp":"劉","surnameKr":"유","surnameOther":"","name":"廙","nameTc":"廙","nameEn":"Yi","nameJp":"廙","nameKr":"이","nameOther":"","word":"恭嗣","wordTc":"恭嗣","wordEn":"Gongsi","wordJp":"恭嗣","wordKr":"공사","wordOther":"","icon":"刘廙","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"213","city":"CS1001","gender":"0","rule":"72","force":"31","wise":"77","politics":"78","charm":"62","will":"54","ruleTalent":"9","forceTalent":"4","wiseTalent":"10","politicsTalent":"10","charmTalent":"8","willTalent":"7","weaponMaster":"11/11/11/11/11/78/33/11","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1015805","debateSoul":"1007805","warSoulPoint":"5200","battleSoulPoint":"1000","debateSoulPoint":"5900","strategy":"","strategy2":"","professions":"0/0/0/0/0/0/2/2/0/2/1/1/0/1/0/1/0/0/1/1/1/0/0/2","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"3","compatible":"25","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"180","show":"213","death":"221","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"0","weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1016005","helmet":"WP1024605","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"2/1;6/1;15/1;23/1;33/1","fa